message: "If you use SkillGate in your work, please cite the software using the metadata below."
title: "SkillGate: Static trust checks for AI-agent skills and MCP configurations"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Zhu"
    given-names: "Chenye"
url: "https://github.com/charliechenye/SkillGate"
