license: MIT
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - agent skills
  - Model Context Protocol
  - MCP
  - static analysis
  - AI security
  - policy as code
  - SARIF
  - CI
abstract: >-
  SkillGate is a deterministic static-analysis tool for AI-agent skills,
  instruction files, helper scripts, and MCP configurations. It detects risky
  capabilities, compares repositories against approved baselines, and blocks
  unapproved changes in local checks and CI.
